ave":"Anyaman Kombo","Pressure Drop":"Penurunan Tekanan","Long Fall":"Kejatuhan Panjang","Last Door":"Pintu Terakhir","Mastery Crown":"Mahkota Penguasaan","Calm":"Tenang","Standard":"Standar","Expert":"Ahli","Minimal Touch":"Sentuhan Minimal","Reach the base with a tight rotation budget.":"Jangkau pangkalan dengan anggaran rotasi yang ketat.","Speedrun Spiral":"Spiral Lari Cepat","Beat the clock to the base.":"Kalahkan jam menuju dasar.","Needlework":"Kerajinan Jarum","Very narrow gaps. Precision is everything.":"Kesenjangan yang sangat sempit. Presisi adalah segalanya.","Drift Storm":"Badai Melayang","Every layer drifts. Read the motion.":"Setiap lapisan melayang. Baca gerakannya.","The Long Drop":"Penurunan Panjang","Forty layers. Endurance and nerve.":"Empat puluh lapisan. Daya tahan dan keberanian.","Breaker":"Penghancur","Danger everywhere — chain drops to smash through.":"Bahaya di mana-mana — rantai jatuhkan untuk menembus.","Rotate the Tower":"Putar Menara","The tower turns; the ball does not. Rotate left and right with ←/→, A/D, the on-screen arrows, or by dragging.":"Menara berputar; bola tidak. Putar ke kiri dan kanan dengan ←/→, A/D, panah di layar, atau dengan menyeret.","Find the Gap":"Temukan Celahnya","Line the glowing gap up with the ball and it drops through. Pass every layer to reach the base.":"Sejajarkan celah bercahaya dengan bola dan bola akan jatuh. Lewati setiap lapisan untuk mencapai dasar.","Danger Sectors":"Sektor Berbahaya","Striped sectors are dangerous. Never land on one — rotate past them before you drop.":"Sektor bergaris berbahaya. Jangan pernah mendarat di salah satunya — putar melewatinya sebelum Anda terjatuh.","Combos":"Kombo","Drop through several layers without landing for bonus points. Aligned gaps make a shaft — release and fall!":"Melewati beberapa lapisan tanpa mendarat untuk mendapatkan poin bonus. Celah yang sejajar membentuk poros — lepaskan dan jatuhkan!","Smash Through":"Hancurkan","Pass 3 layers in one drop and the ball charges up — the next danger sector shatters instead of stopping you.":"Lewati 3 lapisan dalam satu tetes dan bola akan terisi — sektor bahaya berikutnya akan hancur alih-alih menghentikan Anda.","Cancel":"Batal","Erase":"Hapus","Key bindings":"Pengikatan tombol","Open Options":"Buka Opsi","Progress erased.":"Progres dihapus.","Progress restored from your StarHermit cloud save.":"Kemajuan dipulihkan dari penyimpanan cloud StarHermit Anda.","Run over":"Run selesai","Volumes, mute, graphics quality, language, larger text, high contrast and reduced motion are in the StarHermit Options.":"Volume, bisu, kualitas grafis, bahasa, teks lebih besar, kontras tinggi, dan gerakan dikurangi ada di Opsi StarHermit."}
